{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbfc; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b7280; --accent:#6c5ce7; --accent-2:#00b894; --shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(16,24,40,0.08);
      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    /* Unique SVG pattern as data URI (keeps page self-contained) */
    body{margin:0;background-color:var(--bg);background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="360" height="180" viewBox="0 0 360 180"><defs><linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="%236c5ce7" stop-opacity="0.06"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="%2300b894" stop-opacity="0.04"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="360" height="180" fill="%23ffffff"/><g fill="url(%23g)"><circle cx="40" cy="20" r="6"/><circle cx="86" cy="40" r="12"/><circle cx="190" cy="30" r="8"/><circle cx="300" cy="70" r="14"/><rect x="120" y="80" width="90" height="50" rx="8" opacity="0.06"/></g><path d="M0 160 C40 120 60 180 120 160 C180 140 220 160 300 120 C340 100 360 120 360 120 L360 180 L0 180 Z" fill="%23f6f7fb"/></svg>');background-repeat:repeat-x;padding:48px 18px 96px 18px;color:#111827}
    header{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
    .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    .brand h1{font-size:16px;margin:0;color:var(--accent)}
    .brand p{margin:2px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a.active,nav a:hover{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(108,92,231,0.08),rgba(0,184,148,0.03));color:#111827}

    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:20px}
    .hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .hero h2{margin:0;font-size:20px;color:#0f172a}
    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .contact-form label{display:block;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px;font-size:13px}
    .contact-form input,.contact-form textarea,.contact-form select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;margin-top:6px;font-size:14px}
    .contact-form textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;cursor:pointer}
    .alt{background:#eef2ff;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(108,92,231,0.12)}

    aside .section{margin-bottom:16px}
    .planner .option{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eef2f3;margin-top:8px}
    .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
    .chip{background:#f7f8fc;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #eef2f8;color:#1f2937;font-size:13px}
    .summary{white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Monaco,monospace;background:#fbfbff;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed #e6e9ef;margin-top:12px}

    .wizard .step{display:none}
    .wizard .step.active{display:block}
    .wizard .questions{margin-top:12px}
    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:22px auto 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:0 8px}aside{order:-1}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
      <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">My Approach</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Fees &amp; Terms</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQs</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book a Session</a>
      <a href="contact.html" class="active">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="card contact-form">
      <div class="hero">
        <h2>Reach out — we'll make the first step simple</h2>
        <p>Use the form below to say a bit about what brings you. You can also build a short plan or the questions you'd like to bring to a consultation using the tools on the right.</p>
      </div>

      <form id="contact" onsubmit="handleContact(event)">
        <label for="name">Your name</label>
        <input id="name" name="name" required>

        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>

        <div class="row">
          <div style="flex:1">
            <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
          </div>
          <div style="width:160px">
            <label for="city">City</label>
            <input id="city" name="city" placeholder="{{CITY}}">
          </div>
        </div>

        <label for="message">A brief note about what you'd like to address</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message"></textarea>

        <label for="when">When would you like to begin?</label>
        <select id="when" name="when">
          <option>Within 2 weeks</option>
          <option>Within a month</option>
          <option>Flexible / not sure</option>
        </select>

        <p class="note">I aim to reply within 48 hours on weekdays. If this is urgent or a safety concern, please contact local emergency services or crisis lines immediately. I cannot provide emergency services via email.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px">
          <button class="btn" type="submit">Send inquiry</button>
          <a class="btn alt" href="book.html">See availability</a>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">
        <strong>Confidentiality & scope:</strong> Conversations are confidential within the limits of the law. I provide psychotherapy and short-term planning — not emergency care. If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services.
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside>
      <div class="card planner" aria-labelledby="planner-title">
        <h3 id="planner-title">Session Planner</h3>
        <p class="note">Map a short series of sessions and get a plain-text summary you can copy, save, or bring to our first meeting.</p>

        <div class="section">
          <label>Primary focus</label>
          <div class="chips" id="goals">
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-val="Transitioning life changes">Transitioning life changes</button>
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-val="Managing persistent stress">Managing persistent stress</button>
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-val="Relationship patterns">Relationship patterns</button>
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-val="Decision clarity">Decision clarity</button>
            <button type="button" class="chip" data-val="Grief and loss">Grief and loss</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
          <label>Session rhythm</label>
          <div class="option"><input type="radio" name="freq" value="Weekly" id="freq-weekly"><label for="freq-weekly">Weekly</label></div>
          <div class="option"><input type="radio" name="freq" value="Biweekly" id="freq-bi"><label for="freq-bi">Biweekly</label></div>
          <div class="option"><input type="radio" name="freq" value="Monthly" id="freq-monthly"><label for="freq-monthly">Monthly check-ins</label></div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
          <label>Length & intensity</label>
          <select id="length">
            <option value="6 sessions">Short plan — 6 sessions</option>
            <option value="12 sessions">Structured plan — 12 sessions</option>
            <option value="Open">Open, as needed</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
          <label>Preferred session format</label>
          <select id="format">
            <option>Remote video</option>
            <option>Phone</option>
            <option>In-person ({{CITY}}, {{STATE}})</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
          <button class="btn" id="build">Build plan</button>
          <button class="btn alt" id="clearPlanner">Clear</button>
        </div>

        <div class="summary" id="planSummary" aria-live="polite">No plan yet — try selecting goals and options, then Build plan.</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
          <button class="btn" id="copyPlan">Copy plan</button>
          <a class="btn alt" id="exportTxt">Download .txt</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card wizard" style="margin-top:16px" aria-labelledby="wizard-title">
        <h3 id="wizard-title">Self-Screening Intake</h3>
        <p class="note">Short, non-diagnostic prompts to help you reflect before a first consultation. Use the answers to start a conversation.</p>

        <div id="steps">
          <div class="step active" data-step="1">
            <label>What's the situation that led you to seek support now?</label>
            <textarea id="q1" placeholder="A few sentences about what brought you here"></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px">
              <div></div>
              <button class="btn" onclick="nextStep(2)">Next</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step" data-step="2">
            <label>What would you most like to be able to do or feel differently in 3 months?</label>
            <textarea id="q2" placeholder="A short, practical goal"></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px">
              <button class="btn alt" onclick="prevStep(1)">Back</button>
              <button class="btn" onclick="nextStep(3)">Next</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step" data-step="3">
            <label>What has helped you in the past when similar things came up?</label>
            <textarea id="q3" placeholder="Strategies, people, resources"></textarea>
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px">
              <button class="btn alt" onclick="prevStep(2)">Back</button>
              <button class="btn" onclick="finishWizard()">Create questions</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="questionsOutput" class="summary" style="margin-top:12px;display:none"></div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
          <button class="btn" id="copyQuestions" style="display:none">Copy questions</button>
          <button class="btn alt" id="resetWizard" style="display:none">Reset</button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto">Contact: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Please note: email is not a confidential channel for emergencies.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Planner interactivity
    (function(){
      const chips = document.querySelectorAll('.chip');
      chips.forEach(c => c.addEventListener('click', e => {
        e.preventDefault();
        c.classList.toggle('selected');
        c.style.background = c.classList.contains('selected') ? 'linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2))' : '#f7f8fc';
        c.style.color = c.classList.contains('selected') ? '#fff' : '#1f2937';
      }));

      document.getElementById('build').addEventListener('click', () => {
        const selectedGoals = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.chip.selected')).map(n=>n.dataset.val);
        const freq = document.querySelector('input[name="freq"]:checked') ? document.querySelector('input[name="freq"]:checked').value : 'Not selected';
        const length = document.getElementById('length').value;
        const format = document.getElementById('format').value;

        const plan = [];
        plan.push('Plan created:');
        plan.push('Focus: ' + (selectedGoals.length ? selectedGoals.join(', ') : 'General exploration'));
        plan.push('Rhythm: ' + freq);
        plan.push('Length: ' + length);
        plan.push('Format: ' + format);
        plan.push('Notes: A collaborative series focused on practical steps and reflective work. This is a plan to discuss — not a guarantee of outcomes.');
        plan.push('\nNext steps: Bring this summary to your first session; we will refine goals together.');

        const txt = plan.join('\n');
        const out = document.getElementById('planSummary');
        out.textContent = txt;
      });

      document.getElementById('clearPlanner').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        document.querySelectorAll('.chip.selected').forEach(c=>{c.classList.remove('selected');c.style.background='#f7f8fc';c.style.color='#1f2937'});
        document.querySelectorAll('input[name="freq"]').forEach(i=>i.checked=false);
        document.getElementById('length').selectedIndex=0;
        document.getElementById('format').selectedIndex=0;
        document.getElementById('planSummary').textContent = 'No plan yet — try selecting goals and options, then Build plan.';
      });

      document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const text = document.getElementById('planSummary').textContent;
        if(!text) return;
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(()=>{
          const before = document.getElementById('copyPlan').textContent;
          document.getElementById('copyPlan').textContent = 'Copied';
          setTimeout(()=>document.getElementById('copyPlan').textContent = before,1200);
        });
      });

      document.getElementById('exportTxt').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const text = document.getElementById('planSummary').textContent;
        const blob = new Blob([text],'text/plain');
        const a = document.getElementById('exportTxt');
        a.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        a.download = 'session-plan.txt';
      });
    })();

    // Wizard interactivity
    function nextStep(n){
      document.querySelectorAll('.wizard .step').forEach(s=>s.classList.remove('active'));
      const el = document.querySelector('.wizard .step[data-step="'+n+'"]');
      if(el) el.classList.add('active');
    }
    function prevStep(n){ nextStep(n); }
    function finishWizard(){
      const a = document.getElementById('q1').value.trim();
      const b = document.getElementById('q2').value.trim();
      const c = document.getElementById('q3').value.trim();

      const questions = [];
      questions.push('Questions to bring to consultation:');
      if(a) questions.push('- What circumstances led to this moment for me?');
      if(b) questions.push('- What would practical progress look like in 3 months?');
      if(c) questions.push('- What strengths or strategies have I used that might help now?');
      if(!a && !b && !c) questions.push('- I prefer to discuss what feels most important in the first meeting.');

      questions.push('\nMy answers (short):');
      questions.push('Situation: ' + (a || '—'));
      questions.push('Goal: ' + (b || '—'));
      questions.push('What helped before: ' + (c || '—'));

      const out = document.getElementById('questionsOutput');
      out.textContent = questions.join('\n');
      out.style.display = 'block';
      document.getElementById('copyQuestions').style.display = 'inline-flex';
      document.getElementById('resetWizard').style.display = 'inline-flex';
      // collapse steps visually
      document.querySelectorAll('.wizard .step').forEach(s=>s.classList.remove('active'));
    }
    document.getElementById('copyQuestions').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const t = document.getElementById('questionsOutput').textContent;
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(()=>{
        const btn = document.getElementById('copyQuestions');
        const prev = btn.textContent; btn.textContent = 'Copied'; setTimeout(()=>btn.textContent = prev,1200);
      });
    });
    document.getElementById('resetWizard').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      document.getElementById('q1').value=''; document.getElementById('q2').value=''; document.getElementById('q3').value='';
      document.getElementById('questionsOutput').style.display='none';
      document.getElementById('copyQuestions').style.display='none';
      document.getElementById('resetWizard').style.display='none';
      nextStep(1);
    });

    // Contact form handler (local only)
    function handleContact(ev){
      ev.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value;
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value;
      const phone = document.getElementById('phone').value;
      const when = document.getElementById('when').value;
      const message = document.getElementById('message').value;

      const summary = ['New inquiry from '+name,'Email: '+email,'Phone: '+(phone||'—'),'When: '+when,'Message:\n'+message].join('\n');

      // Simulate send: show a simple confirmation and clear
      alert('Thank you — your message is ready to send.\n\n'+summary);
      document.getElementById('contact').reset();
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# private_practice_therapist-MORE-2026-02-17T07-53-46-127Z-031 (chunk 4)

This chunk includes two files for the site build:

- contact.html — The contact/connect page with two interactive tools:
  - Session Planner: build a simple plan (select goals, rhythm, length, format), view a plain-text summary, copy it, or download as .txt. No external services; uses clipboard and blob download APIs.
  - Self-Screening Intake Wizard: three-step reflection tool that produces a non-diagnostic question list and a short answers summary you can copy. Designed to help clients prepare for the first conversation.
  - A basic contact form that gathers name, email, phone, timing, and message. The handler simulates a send and shows a confirmation (local only).
  - Privacy/confidentiality and crisis notes are included.

- README.md — This file.

Placeholders included in contact.html that need to be replaced in the final build:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Accessibility & notes:
- Interactive elements use semantic controls and provide aria-live feedback for generated summaries.
- The planner and wizard are purely client-side. No external assets or CDNs are used; an inline SVG data URI provides a subtle background pattern.
- Content intentionally avoids clinical guarantees and emergency handling; a crisis note directs people to emergency services for urgent needs.

If you need this page adapted (different fields, export formats, or integration with a backend appointment system), tell me which endpoint or format to target and I will update the scripts accordingly."}
BUNDLE_END
